{
  "name": "ListCdnStatistics",
  "summary": "查询CDN统计信息",
  "tags": "统计分析",
  "productshort": "VOD",
  "region_id": "cn-east-2",
  "paths": {
    "/v2/{project_id}/asset/cdn-statistics": {
      "get": {
        "description": "查询CDN的统计数据,包括流量、峰值带宽、请求总数、请求命中率、流量命中率。查询存在1小时误差。",
        "summary": "查询CDN统计信息",
        "operationId": "ListCdnStatistics",
        "x-apiexplorer-hide": "N",
        "x-support-sdk": "Y",
        "x-api-type": "open-api",
        "x-is-registered": "Y",
        "x-external-api": true,
        "tags": [
          "统计分析"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/parameters/xAuthToken"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/parameters/xSdkDate"
          },
          {
            "name": "project_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "项目ID,获取方法请参考[获取项目ID](vod_04_0211.xml)",
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 64,
            "x-example": "70b76xxxxxx34253880af501cdxxxxxx",
            "required": true
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "start_time",
            "minLength": 0,
            "maxLength": 14,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "description": "开始时间,格式为yyyymmddhhmmss。\n\n\n- interval为300时,end_time设置为整5分钟时刻点,如:20240601000000。\n\n\n- interval为3600时,end_time设置为整小时时刻点,如:20240601120000。\n\n\n- interval为86400时,end_time设置为东8区零点时刻点,如:20240601000000。\n\n\n- 只能查询最近三个月内的数据,且时间跨度不能超过31天。"
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "end_time",
            "minLength": 0,
            "maxLength": 14,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "description": "结束时间,格式为yyyymmddhhmmss。\n\n\n- interval为300时,end_time设置为整5分钟时刻点,如:20240601000000。\n\n\n- interval为3600时,end_time设置为整小时时刻点,如:20240601120000。\n\n\n- interval为86400时,end_time设置为东8区零点时刻点,如:20240601000000。\n\n\n- 只能查询最近三个月内的数据,且时间跨度不能超过31天。"
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "stat_type",
            "minLength": 0,
            "maxLength": 1000,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "description": "统计数据类型。\n\n取值如下:\n- bw:CDN峰值带宽\n- flux:CDN流量\n- req_num:请求总数\n- req_hit_rate:请求命中率\n- flux_hit_rate:流量命中率\n- http_code_2xx 状态码汇总2xx\n- http_code_3xx 状态码汇总3xx\n- http_code_4xx 状态码汇总4xx\n- http_code_5xx 状态码汇总5xx\n\n每次只能查询一种统计数据。"
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "domain",
            "minLength": 0,
            "maxLength": 5000,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "description": "域名列表,多个域名以逗号(半角)分隔。\n\n示例:example.test1.com,example.test2.com。\n\nALL表示查询名下全部域名。一次最多查询20个域名。"
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "interval",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 86400,
            "required": false,
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "查询粒度间隔。\n\n取值如下:\n- 300(5分钟):最大查询跨度2天。\n- 3600(1小时):最大查询跨度7天。\n- 86400(1天):最大查询跨度31天,最少跨度为2天。\n\n单位:秒。\n\n若不设置,小于1天 300,大于1天小于7天3600,大于7天86400。"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "处理成功返回。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ShowCdnStatRsp"
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "处理失败返回。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ErrorResponse"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "definitions": {
    "ErrorResponse": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "error_code": {
          "description": "错误码。\n",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "error_msg": {
          "description": "错误描述。\n",
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "ShowCdnStatRsp": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "start_time": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "统计起始时间\n"
        },
        "interval": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "采样时间间隔\n"
        },
        "result": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "int64"
            }
          },
          "description": "cdn数据查询结果\n"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "2.0",
  "parameters": {
    "xSdkDate": {
      "name": "X-Sdk-Date",
      "in": "header",
      "description": "使用AK/SK方式认证时必选,请求的发生时间。\n",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "maxLength": 256,
      "x-example": "20191115T033655Z"
    },
    "xAuthToken": {
      "name": "X-Auth-Token",
      "in": "header",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "用户Token,使用Token鉴权方式时必选。\n\n通过调用IAM服务获取用户Token接口获取(响应消息头中X-Subject-Token的值)。\n",
      "required": false,
      "minLength": 0,
      "maxLength": 16384
    }
  },
  "host": "vod.cn-east-2.myhuaweicloud.com",
  "base_path": "/",
  "info_version": "v1",
  "method": "get",
  "uri": null
}